[
  {
    "title": "Traversing Lists",
    "tag": "LESSON 18",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 4 · Data & Reusable Algorithms",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Traversing<br>Lists</h1><p class=\"zh\">遍历 · 累加器 · 筛选</p><p class=\"small\">Build a Session Filter &amp; Total · 90 minutes</p>",
    "note": "今天把上一课列表与第三章循环组合。程序会逐个读元素并汇总，还会生成一个新的筛选结果列表；保持原列表不变。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve the list model",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.D · AAP-2.N",
    "html": "<ol><li>For a ← [30, 30, 10], what is LENGTH(a)?</li><li>What does APPEND(a, 20) change?</li><li>Does reading a[2] remove that element?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>3; adds 20 at the end and increases length to 4; no.</strong></div></details>",
    "note": "再次确认重复值各占元素位置。APPEND题从初始列表进行，读取题只问操作性质，不让上下文状态歧义。"
  },
  {
    "title": "One traversal, several useful results",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.1–4",
    "html": "<ol><li>Trace FOR EACH in list order.</li><li>Initialize and update accumulators.</li><li>Filter into a new list without changing the source.</li><li>Test duplicates, thresholds and an empty list.</li></ol>",
    "note": "遍历不等于排序或去重。范围是完整遍历与汇总/筛选；线性搜索将在另一课展开，最大最小值和平均值不在今天完整实现。"
  },
  {
    "title": "FOR EACH visits values in order",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A left-to-right traversal visits each of three list values once.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 140\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"475\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">7</text><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"800\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><path d=\"M410 80H458\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M456 73L470 80L456 87Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><path d=\"M735 80H783\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M781 73L795 80L781 87Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/></svg></figure><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">FOR EACH item IN a\n{\n  DISPLAY(item)\n}</pre><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">For a = [4, 7, 2], the output values are <strong>4, 7, 2</strong>, in that order.</div></details>",
    "note": "先设a为图中列表再追踪。每次item得到当前元素的值，然后执行一次循环体；不是让item从1数到长度。所有大括号单独成行。"
  },
  {
    "title": "The loop variable is an element value",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Indices1,2,3 label values40,70,20; the loop variable takes the values, not the indices.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 140\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">40</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"475\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">70</text><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"800\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">20</text></svg></figure><p class=\"lead\">FOR EACH minutes IN sessions</p><p>Does minutes take 1, 2, 3 or 40, 70, 20?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>40, 70, 20.</strong> Do not use sessions[minutes] to mean the current element.</div></details>",
    "note": "用值明显不同于索引的例子避免偶然答对。若写sessions[minutes]会尝试访问40等非法索引。这里直接使用minutes，不教循环中改源列表。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An accumulator remembers progress",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An accumulator starts at0 and updates by adding the next element on each visit.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Before traversal</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total ← 0</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Each visit</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total ← total + item</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">After traversal</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">one total</text></svg></figure><p>Initialize once before the loop, then update inside it.</p><details><summary>Show why zero works</summary><div class=\"answer\">Zero is the starting total because no values have been processed yet.</div></details>",
    "note": "用已处理前缀解释total，初始空前缀和为0。初始化如果放在循环体内会每次丢失之前进度，后面用诊断题检验。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Trace the changing total",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.3–4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"After visiting4, then7, then2, three checkpoints ask for the accumulated totals.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Visit 4</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total = ?</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Then visit 7</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total = ?</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Then visit 2</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total = ?</text></svg></figure><p>Start with total = 0. Each visit adds the current value.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>4 → 11 → 13.</strong> The final total includes each occurrence once.</div></details>",
    "note": "本页让学生写中间状态，不能只报最后13。值顺序会改变中间和，但在本次数值相加任务中不会改变最终和；不要推广到所有算法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Count and total answer different questions",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Counting increments by1; summing adds the actual current value.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">How many entries?</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">count ← count + 1</text><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">How many minutes?</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total ← total + minutes</text></svg></figure><p>For [10, 30, 30], find the count and total minutes.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>3 entries; 70 minutes.</strong> Duplicate values still represent separate entries.</div></details>",
    "note": "两种累加器都是更新，但被加的量不同。count等价于长度只适用于无条件计每个元素；条件计数只统计满足条件的访问次数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Filter by appending matches",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · AAP-2.N",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">selected ← []\nFOR EACH minutes IN sessions\n{\n  IF (minutes ≥ 30)\n  {\n    APPEND(selected, minutes)\n  }\n}</pre><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Only matching values are appended to <strong>selected</strong>. Their original order is preserved.</div></details>",
    "note": "循环前建空结果列表，每次条件真时追加当前值。源sessions没有任何写操作；不要把REMOVE放进遍历，避免跳项和语言差异。这里循环体内有IF，是既有知识的组合。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Duplicates are visited separately",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Both30-minute entries occupy distinct positions and each satisfies a threshold of30.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 140\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"475\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"800\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">10</text></svg></figure><p>Filter values ≥ 30 from [30, 30, 10].</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[30, 30].</strong> This is filtering, not deduplication.</div></details>",
    "note": "两个30如果代表两次活动，保留重复很关键。区别唯一值数量1与合格活动次数2。图用位置说明为什么同值也需访问两次。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An empty list makes zero visits",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "36–39 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An empty source has zero loop visits; initial accumulator and result list remain unchanged.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Source</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">[]</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Body executions</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Initial state kept</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">total: 0</text></svg></figure><p>If selected starts as [], what is it after this traversal?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[]</strong>, with length 0. No element is read.</div></details>",
    "note": "空列表FOR EACH循环体零次执行，不会尝试取第1项。total0和selected[]都保留初始值。若后续求平均还须防止除0，本节不要求该功能。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Read the source; build a separate result",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "39–42 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · AAP-1.D",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source values flow through a condition into a new output collection; no arrow writes back to the source.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Read only</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">sessions</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Keep when true</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">minutes ≥ goal</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">New list</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">selected</text></svg></figure><p>During FOR EACH, do not insert or remove elements in sessions.</p><details><summary>Show the design reason</summary><div class=\"answer\">Appending to <strong>selected</strong> changes a different list, so the source traversal stays stable.</div></details>",
    "note": "这是本课堂实现约束，避免遍历期间改变源集合的特殊行为；不是声称所有语言都完全禁止。原列表完整保留也便于复核筛选条件和结果。"
  },
  {
    "title": "The same loop handles changing sizes",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "42–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.D · AAP-2.O",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lists of zero, one and many values can be processed by the same FOR EACH structure.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">No entries</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">[]</text><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">One entry</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">[30]</text><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Many entries</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">[20, 30, 45, 10]</text></svg></figure><p>A traversal avoids a separate statement for every fixed position.</p><details><summary>Show a concrete abstraction benefit</summary><div class=\"answer\">The loop runs once per element without rewriting the program when the list length changes.</div></details>",
    "note": "把列表抽象和算法组合联系起来：相关记录一名集合，同一循环处理变化数量。不要宣称所有输入都无需验证，仍需要数值单位和类型前提。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Session Filter & Total",
    "tag": "LAB SETUP",
    "time": "44–49 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · AAP-2.N",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_4_Algorithms_Lab.html#traversal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Chapter 4 Lab → Traversal</a></p><p>For a fictional session list, find total minutes and build a new list of sessions at least goal minutes long.</p><p class=\"small\">Set list literals and goal in code; no INPUT queue is required.</p>",
    "note": "主输入[20,30,45,10]，goal30，均为合成数值。展示总分钟、匹配列表及它的长度，避免只显示最后元素。"
  },
  {
    "title": "1 · Plan the loop state",
    "tag": "FILTER & TOTAL · 5 MINUTES",
    "time": "49–54 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O",
